{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40335","headline":"早春池亭独游三首 三 · 刘象","name":"早春池亭独游三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一瓢欢自足，一日兴偏多。\n幽意人先赏，疎丛蝶未过。\n知音新句苦，窥沼醉颜酡。\n万虑从相拟，今朝欲奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}